### STOREKEEPER TESTING (Limited Permissions)
### ============================================

### Storekeeper: View Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{storekeeperToken}}

### Storekeeper: View Inventory
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventory
Authorization: Bearer {{storekeeperToken}}

### Storekeeper: Stock In (Allowed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventory/stock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{storekeeperToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "locationId": "{{locationId}}",
  "quantity": 20,
  "reason": "Storekeeper receiving stock"
}

